<title>SPAIN: SPANISH BONDS SLIDE INTO CLOSE BUT ABOVE LOWS.</title>
<headline>SPANISH BONDS SLIDE INTO CLOSE BUT ABOVE LOWS.</headline>
<text>
<p>1645 GMT - Government bonds slide into close after Bundesbank interest rate warning and bounding mark.</p>
<p>* 10-yr 7.35 pct T-bond 106.85 vs 107.47, yield 6.36 vs 6.28</p>
<p>* Sept bond future 116.45 vs 117.09 at Tuesday's close</p>
<p>* Peseta/mark 84.56/58 vs 84.38/40</p>
